{
    "title": "Slice: Pizza Delivery/Pick Up",
    "description": "Order from your favorite pizzeria with Slice. We empower your go-to local independent pizza shop so you can get the food you love fast, easy, and with tracked delivery. \r\n\r\nThere\u2019s no crazy fees for you or your pizzeria, and you\u2019ll earn free pizza for being a loyal customer!\r\n\r\n<b>Put Local Shops First</b>\r\nLocal pizzerias are at the heart of our communities. And we\u2019re here to keep it that way. Slice gives your favorite independent pizza shop the tools and tech they need to thrive. That means they have more time to focus on making tasty pizza, and you get your order fast, tracked, and accurate. \r\n\r\n<b>Get Real Pizza</b>\r\nOur independent pizzeria partners serve up deliciously authentic local pizza in communities all across the country. Slice works behind the scenes with your local shop so you can easily customize your pizza exactly how you like it. Extra cheese? You got it. Half pepperoni, half pineapple? No problem. Get your pizza, your way. With the Slice app, you can also save your go-to order for next time.\r\n\r\n<b>Earn Free Pizza</b>\r\nYep, really. You\u2019ll earn one Pizza Point for every order over $30, and it only takes eight Pizza Points to earn a free large cheese pizza. And speaking of free, your first Pizza Point is on us.\r\n\r\n<b>Better Food, Better Service</b>\r\nWhy settle for fast food delivery when you can get delicious pizza from local shops delivered by a trusted pizza person straight to your door? Slice has the answer to those three magic words: \u201cPizza near me\u201d. Or mozzarella sticks, wings, hot wings, salads, pasta\u2026 Do your food ordering, then opt for pizza delivery, take out, pickup, takeaway, contactless curbside pickup, or no-contact delivery. You can use our pizza tracker for live updates at every step, and whether you prefer credit card, PayPal, Google Pay, or Apple Pay, every type of payment is secure. Pizza is almost always perfect, but just in case, our top-ranked customer support team works hand-in-hand with your local shop to get you exactly what you want. \r\n\r\n<b>Save Time, Save Money</b>\r\nThe Slice app isn\u2019t just the easiest way to order pizza \u2014 it also shows you your favorite pizzeria\u2019s latest special offers, exclusive deals, and promotions. There\u2019s no inflated prices or hidden charges because unlike third-party delivery apps, Slice is your shop\u2019s direct partner. Switch from ordering on those delivery apps to ordering directly with Slice and you could save big: The average family saves over $200 a year! Slice makes it easy to get the food you love for less money, all while supporting your community\u2019s restaurants. \r\n\r\n<b>One-Tap Ordering, Real-Time Tracking</b>\r\nSlice the pizza app makes ordering easy (and reordering even easier). You\u2019ll get an estimated delivery time for your pizza. Plus, keep your eyes on the pies with Slice\u2019s real-time pizza tracker.\r\n\r\n<b>Find Your Favorite Restaurants on Slice</b>\r\nAs well as neighborhood spots, we\u2019re proud to partner with local favorites like Jet's Pizza, Cicis Pizza, Round Table Pizza, Uno Pizzeria & Grill, Rosati's Pizza, Patxi's Pizza, Vocelli Pizza, and Sarpino\u2019s Pizzeria, plus over 18,000 more local restaurants in hundreds of locations across the country for takeout or delivery.\r\n\r\nGet the pizza app that connects you to your favorite local pizzerias. You\u2019ll enjoy the freshest, most authentic pizza in your neighborhood, without any phone calls, \u201chold pleases,\u201d or busy signals when you try to figure out where your food is! \r\n\r\nDownload the Slice app today, order tasty food, and make tonight your best pizza night yet.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Order from your favorite pizzeria with Slice. We empower your go-to local independent pizza shop so you can get the food you love fast, easy, and with tracked delivery. <br><br>There\u2019s no crazy fees for you or your pizzeria, and you\u2019ll earn free pizza for being a loyal customer!<br><br><b>Put Local Shops First</b><br>Local pizzerias are at the heart of our communities. And we\u2019re here to keep it that way. Slice gives your favorite independent pizza shop the tools and tech they need to thrive. That means they have more time to focus on making tasty pizza, and you get your order fast, tracked, and accurate. <br><br><b>Get Real Pizza</b><br>Our independent pizzeria partners serve up deliciously authentic local pizza in communities all across the country. Slice works behind the scenes with your local shop so you can easily customize your pizza exactly how you like it. Extra cheese? You got it. Half pepperoni, half pineapple? No problem. Get your pizza, your way. With the Slice app, you can also save your go-to order for next time.<br><br><b>Earn Free Pizza</b><br>Yep, really. You\u2019ll earn one Pizza Point for every order over $30, and it only takes eight Pizza Points to earn a free large cheese pizza. And speaking of free, your first Pizza Point is on us.<br><br><b>Better Food, Better Service</b><br>Why settle for fast food delivery when you can get delicious pizza from local shops delivered by a trusted pizza person straight to your door? Slice has the answer to those three magic words: \u201cPizza near me\u201d. Or mozzarella sticks, wings, hot wings, salads, pasta\u2026 Do your food ordering, then opt for pizza delivery, take out, pickup, takeaway, contactless curbside pickup, or no-contact delivery. You can use our pizza tracker for live updates at every step, and whether you prefer credit card, PayPal, Google Pay, or Apple Pay, every type of payment is secure. Pizza is almost always perfect, but just in case, our top-ranked customer support team works hand-in-hand with your local shop to get you exactly what you want. <br><br><b>Save Time, Save Money</b><br>The Slice app isn\u2019t just the easiest way to order pizza \u2014 it also shows you your favorite pizzeria\u2019s latest special offers, exclusive deals, and promotions. There\u2019s no inflated prices or hidden charges because unlike third-party delivery apps, Slice is your shop\u2019s direct partner. Switch from ordering on those delivery apps to ordering directly with Slice and you could save big: The average family saves over $200 a year! Slice makes it easy to get the food you love for less money, all while supporting your community\u2019s restaurants. <br><br><b>One-Tap Ordering, Real-Time Tracking</b><br>Slice the pizza app makes ordering easy (and reordering even easier). You\u2019ll get an estimated delivery time for your pizza. Plus, keep your eyes on the pies with Slice\u2019s real-time pizza tracker.<br><br><b>Find Your Favorite Restaurants on Slice</b><br>As well as neighborhood spots, we\u2019re proud to partner with local favorites like Jet&#39;s Pizza, Cicis Pizza, Round Table Pizza, Uno Pizzeria &amp; Grill, Rosati&#39;s Pizza, Patxi&#39;s Pizza, Vocelli Pizza, and Sarpino\u2019s Pizzeria, plus over 18,000 more local restaurants in hundreds of locations across the country for takeout or delivery.<br><br>Get the pizza app that connects you to your favorite local pizzerias. You\u2019ll enjoy the freshest, most authentic pizza in your neighborhood, without any phone calls, \u201chold pleases,\u201d or busy signals when you try to figure out where your food is! <br><br>Download the Slice app today, order tasty food, and make tonight your best pizza night yet.",
